+  "compilerOptions": {
+    "target": "ES2022",
+    "module": "Preserve",
+    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
+    "strict": true,
+    "noEmit": true,
+    "types": ["bun-types"]
+  },
+  "include": ["src", "test"]
+}
*** Add File: README.md
+# Mini Template
+
+A dependency-free TypeScript template renderer for Bun.
+
+```ts
+import { render } from "./src/engine";
+
+render("Hello, {{user.name}}!", { user: { name: "Ada" } });
+```
+
+Supported syntax:
+
+- `{{path}}` for HTML-escaped interpolation and `{{{path}}}` for raw interpolation
+- `{{#if path}}...{{else}}...{{/if}}` for conditional blocks
+- `{{#each path}}...{{else}}...{{/each}}` for arrays, with `{{this}}` and `{{@index}}`
+- `{{! comment }}` for comments
+
+Run the CLI with a template and JSON data file:
+
+```sh
+bun run src/cli.ts template.txt data.json
+```
+
+Run self-tests with `bun test`.
*** End Patch

